        10["<div style='font-weight: bold'>AUTO</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: JavaScript]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>The AUTO button (formerly<br />Perfect): while held (and no<br />sheet or dialog is up, and<br />the player isn't steering,<br />gathering or working a tile)<br />it asks the brain for the<br />next intent about four times<br />a second and has the<br />Controller carry it out, the<br />same calls a tap makes. Keeps<br />the badge (what it's doing),<br />waits at Embark with a toast,<br />and keeps the screen awake<br />while held.</div>"]
