        6["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Tick and Deadline Engine</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: JavaScript]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Shared 60 Hz logical clock.<br />Browser catch-up is bounded;<br />the headless runner coalesces<br />stationary ticks ending at<br />AUTO/goal deadlines,<br />retaining fine motion and<br />first Embark eligibility.<br />Cumulative battery intervals<br />preserve daylight<br />transitions. Injected<br />controller, AUTO and input<br />interfaces keep scheduling<br />independent of presentation.<br />Blocked UI suspends<br />AUTO-owned movement.</div>"]
