        9["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Controller</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: JavaScript]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Applies intents to the game:<br />tap (descend, harvest,<br />collect, or walk there round<br />obstacles: planWalk/walkAim<br />in core paths.js, replanned<br />when a hoped-open route<br />through fog turns out<br />blocked), Gather (collect,<br />else harvest, else Explore<br />walks to the nearest<br />resource) and its hold,<br />AUTO's intents (perform),<br />Trail sweeps (every way of<br />working a tile takes turns on<br />one hand clock, core<br />pace.js), going down and up<br />between layers, buying,<br />building, embarking,<br />resetting. One queued<br />approach/action routes<br />observed cardinal contact<br />sites once per order, faces<br />the object, then calls the<br />Core. New movement, orders or<br />layer/world changes cancel<br />it. Crafting and carried<br />equipment need no<br />destination. Each calls the<br />Core, then triggers effects,<br />sound, HUD and a save.</div>"]
